        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3c0bf377-5975-5676-846c-bf7518fc540e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Myles Kennedy, Mark Tremonti, Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette, John Connolly, Vinnie Hornsby, Scott Phillips, Eric Friedman\n- Bands: Alter Bridge, Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators, SafetySuit, Projected, Sevendust, Creed, Submersed, Tremonti\n- Places: Tulsa, Oklahoma, Nashville, Tennessee\n- Songs and Albums: \"Rise Today\", Blackbird\n\nFacts:\n- Myles Kennedy was born as Myles Richard Bass on November 27, 1969.\n- Myles Kennedy is an American musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- SafetySuit is an American pop rock and alternative rock band from Tulsa, Oklahoma, and it is currently based in Nashville, Tennessee.\n- \"Rise Today\" was written by Alter Bridge lead guitarist Mark Tremonti and lead vocalist Myles Kennedy.\n- \"Rise Today\" was produced by Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette and was featured on Alter Bridge's 2007 second studio album Blackbird.\n- Myles Kennedy is best known as the lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Alter Bridge.\n- Myles Kennedy is also the lead vocalist in Slash's backing band, Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators.\n- Projected is an American rock supergroup made up of Sevendust members John Connolly and Vinnie Hornsby, Alter Bridge and Creed drummer Scott Phillips, and former Submersed and current Tremonti guitarist Eric Friedman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "bebe1dc3-79fa-5159-943c-c92aeefee767",
        "text": "Page: Myles Kennedy. Sentence: Myles Richard Kennedy (born Myles Richard Bass; November 27, 1969) is an American musician, singer, and songwriter, best known as the lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of the rock band Alter Bridge, and as the lead vocalist in guitarist Slash's backing band, known as Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators.\nPage: SafetySuit. Sentence: SafetySuit is an American pop rock and alternative rock band from Tulsa, Oklahoma, currently based in Nashville, Tennessee.\nPage: Rise Today. Sentence: Written by lead guitarist Mark Tremonti and lead vocalist Myles Kennedy, it was produced by Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette and featured on the band's 2007 second studio album \"Blackbird\".\nPage: Projected. Sentence: Projected is an American rock supergroup consisting of Sevendust members John Connolly and Vinnie Hornsby, Alter Bridge and Creed drummer Scott Phillips, and former Submersed and current Tremonti guitarist Eric Friedman.",
